## Original Content
At least 10 people were killed and over 10 others injured in intercommunal clashes in Chad's Batha Province, local media and witnesses said Friday.

## Summary
Intercommunal clashes occurred in Chad's Batha Province, resulting in at least 10 deaths and over 10 injuries. The incident was reported by local media and witnesses on Friday.

